# {{ project_name }}

A [PyForge](https://github.com/pyforge-wq/pyforge) application.

## Getting started

```bash
pyforge serve
```

Then visit http://localhost:8000/docs for the interactive API docs (generated
automatically by FastAPI), or http://localhost:8000/ for the welcome route.

## Project layout

- `app/` - controllers, models, services, and everything else your app owns.
- `routes/` - `api.py` and `web.py` register your routes.
- `config/` - one file per configuration namespace, read via `config("app.name")`.
- `database/` - migrations and seeders (Phase 2 of PyForge).
- `tests/` - pytest tests, including a working example for the welcome route.
